      "spoken": "The tunnel links Innsbruck and Fortezza over 55 kilometres. With the Innsbruck bypass it is 64 tunnel kilometres, which the builder says will be the longest underground rail link in the world. Its highest point lies 580 metres lower than the Brenner Pass.",
